<title>CANADA: Canada grain, livestock markets closed for holiday.</title>
<headline>Canada grain, livestock markets closed for holiday.</headline>
<dateline>WINNIPEG 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Winnipeg Commodity Exchange and most other Canadian grain and livestock markets are closed on Monday for a civic holiday.</p>
<p>The markets will reopen on Tuesday.</p>
<p>Market and public holidays will be observed in all provinces on Monday except Quebec, which is open for business as usual.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312 408 8720))</p>
